[Desktop Entry]
Type=Application
Name=Kinect Room
GenericName=Room Awareness
Comment=Who is in the room, zones, sitting reminders, pointing at things, and where the Kinect tracks well
Keywords=kinect;room;presence;zones;home assistant;posture;
